---
title: Fajitas
---

== Black Beans ==

Heat @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #pan.

Add chopped @onion{3%tbsp} and saute for ~{3-4%minutes}.

Rinse and drain @black beans{1%can}.

When onions turn golden brown, add the black beans.

Add @taco seasoning{1%tsp} and mix well.

Saute for ~{3-4%minutes} more.

== Avocado Dip (Guacamole) ==

Mash @avocado{1} in a #bowl using a #fork.

Add chopped @onion{3%slices}, diced @tomato{1}, chopped @cilantro{1}, @salt{1/4%tsp}, @lemon juice{1%tsp}, and @chilli powder{1/4%tsp}. Mix well.

== Vegetables ==

Thinly slice all vegetables: @red pepper{1}, @green pepper{1}, @yellow pepper{1}, @zucchini{1}, @jalapeno{2}, @carrot{1}, and @onion{1}.

Heat up @olive oil{} in a #large pan{}.

Add onion slices and saute for ~{2-3%minutes}.

Add sliced carrots, saute for ~{5-7%minutes}.

Add all peppers, zucchini, and sliced @mushroom{1%cup}.

Saute everything on medium heat for ~{10%minutes} or until everything looks cooked.

Garnish with @salt{} and @crushed black pepper{}.

== Fajitas ==

Spread a bit of @olive oil{4%tbsp} in a #pan and slightly grill @wheat tortilla{}.

On each tortilla layer the following items: prepared black beans, prepared vegetables, shredded @lettuce{1%cup}, prepared guacamole, @sour cream{}, and @salsa{}. Top with @mexican cheese{}.
